==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Boundaries Crossed|Duskull|61}} from the {{TCG|Boundaries Crossed}} expansion.
*'''Ambush''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Giovanni's Persian|8}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
